ferrosintesis-samples-dark-salamander
=====================================

The embedded WAV samples in this crate are derived from "Salamander Grand Piano
V3" by Alexander Holm (a Yamaha C5 grand), with a high-shelf EQ cut applied to
darken/warm the tone. They therefore inherit the source's licence:

  Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC BY 3.0):
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

ATTRIBUTION (required by CC BY 3.0):
